# Edge cases of two replacements. Intra-group flows (A -> B, C -> D)
# and a flow to the replacer itself (A -> AB) collapse to self-loops
# and are dropped. A -> C and B -> D carry the same label and both
# become AB -> CD: kept once. A -> D carries another label: a second
# AB -> CD is kept. D -> B becomes CD -> AB.

process A
process B
process C
process D
process AB
process CD

A -> B   inside ab
C -> D   inside cd
A -> C   same label
B -> D   same label
A -> D   other label
D -> B   back
A -> AB  to my replacer

merge A B : AB
merge C D : CD
